   "x": 40,
   "y": 570,
   "width": 1122,
   "height": 21,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "so it only works for whole numbers in a small range (0 to 9 here). A range of 0 to 1 billion would need 1 billion boxes.",
